# graphify (Desarticulator)

Canonical explore rule: global `graphify.mdc`.

Desarticulator-only:

- After code changes, prefer `graphify update .` (AST-only). No nested product merge script (unlike Tervia’s `./scripts/graphify-rebuild.sh`).
- Dirty `graphify-out/` is expected; skip graphify only if the task is about a stale/wrong graph or the user says so.
